288
00:09:35,449 --> 00:09:37,589
Tae Hyun and In Sung tire me out. Seriously.

289
00:09:37,589 --> 00:09:38,849
- They tire me out.
- Jae Seok's arch nemesis.

290
00:09:40,459 --> 00:09:42,659
