302
00:10:03,849 --> 00:10:04,849
- I see.
- Read it.

303
00:10:04,849 --> 00:10:06,549
Her name is Park Jung Hwa.

304
00:10:07,019 --> 00:10:10,049
"Pop, pop, pop. We're crazy about that popping sound."

305
00:10:10,049 --> 00:10:11,119
What's that?

306
00:10:11,189 --> 00:10:13,359
"We see each other throughout the week."

307
00:10:13,389 --> 00:10:16,359
"But we don't know each other's age, job, or neighborhood."

308
00:10:16,359 --> 00:10:18,459
