310
00:10:20,399 --> 00:10:23,669
"Will this be a chance for us to get closer?"

311
00:10:24,769 --> 00:10:26,899
- Are they in a club or something?
- "Pop?"

312
00:10:26,899 --> 00:10:28,569
They drift apart a touch further?

313
00:10:28,569 --> 00:10:29,939
But they see each other all week.

314
00:10:30,439 --> 00:10:32,239
"We see each other throughout the week."

315
00:10:32,239 --> 00:10:33,239
(It's hard to figure out Whenever Guest's identity.)

316
00:10:33,239 --> 00:10:35,239
