- Where is it?

318
00:10:38,109 --> 00:10:39,819
It takes 17 minutes on foot.

319
00:10:40,079 --> 00:10:41,219
We can take our time and walk there.

320
00:10:42,219 --> 00:10:43,289
- My gosh.
- Do we get a lot of time...

321
00:10:43,289 --> 00:10:44,289
to practice?

322
00:10:44,289 --> 00:10:45,289
- What?
- Can we...

323
00:10:45,289 --> 00:10:46,759
We don't know what game it is. So we can't practice.

324
00:10:46,759 --> 00:10:49,729
- We can practice before the game.
- After they tell us what it is.

325
00:10:50,489 --> 00:10:52,759
- But...
- Don't turn your back like that.

326
00:10:53,399 --> 00:10:54,429
Hello.

327
00:10:54,899 --> 00:10:55,899
Hello.

328
00:10:56,499 --> 00:10:58,229
- Hello.
- They're going on a walk.

329
00:10:58,229 --> 00:11:00,469
I take it that Ki Joo hasn't filmed...

330
00:11:00,469 --> 00:11:02,139
