332
00:11:04,039 --> 00:11:05,609
It's nice with the breeze.

333
00:11:07,139 --> 00:11:09,479
It feels weird to be filming in my neighborhood.

334
00:11:09,479 --> 00:11:10,549
- Right?
- Yes.

335
00:11:10,779 --> 00:11:13,149
- To be honest, I feel uneasy...
- Left?

336
00:11:13,149 --> 00:11:15,479
