- Are you embarrassed? Right.

337
00:11:16,049 --> 00:11:17,289
You feel the same way, right?

338
00:11:17,389 --> 00:11:18,649
- Right, Ki Joo?
- Yes.

339
00:11:18,649 --> 00:11:19,689
I feel perfectly fine...

340
00:11:19,689 --> 00:11:20,719
- in other neighborhoods.
- Right.

341
00:11:20,719 --> 00:11:22,259
- But I fear I might run into...
- It feels weird here.

342
00:11:22,259 --> 00:11:23,529
my friends in my neighborhood.

343
00:11:23,529 --> 00:11:25,489
- It feels weird.
- It does feel weird.

344
00:11:26,229 --> 00:11:27,759
Ki Joo, do you walk around your neighborhood a lot?

345
00:11:27,759 --> 00:11:29,769
If we go this way, we'll see Mount Acha.

346
00:11:29,769 --> 00:11:32,199
- Right.
- When I want to climb Mount Acha,

347
00:11:32,199 --> 00:11:34,039
- I'd walk through here.
- Right.

348
00:11:34,039 --> 00:11:35,399
- What a beautiful neighborhood.
- It's nice.

349
00:11:35,399 --> 00:11:36,539
(It's perfect for walks.)

350
00:11:36,539 --> 00:11:39,009
Are you still a professor at Sejong University?

351
00:11:39,009 --> 00:11:40,139
- He's still a professor.
- Right?

352
00:11:40,139 --> 00:11:41,939
