- That's right.

354
00:11:43,909 --> 00:11:45,009
The semester ended.

355
00:11:45,109 --> 00:11:47,779
- Was it fun?
- It was fun.

356
00:11:48,119 --> 00:11:50,349
It took me back to my college days...

357
00:11:50,349 --> 00:11:52,249
- when I studied acting.
- I see.

358
00:11:52,759 --> 00:11:54,389
And students like me too.

359
00:11:54,389 --> 00:11:56,459
- I...
- Having him as a professor...

360
00:11:56,459 --> 00:11:58,859
