- I bet they ask a lot of questions.

361
00:11:59,699 --> 00:12:01,799
- I also give special lectures.
- Right.

362
00:12:02,329 --> 00:12:03,699
You should invite Jae Seok for a special lecture.

363
00:12:04,429 --> 00:12:05,799
Right. He totally should.

364
00:12:05,799 --> 00:12:06,799
You should come for a lecture too.

365
00:12:06,799 --> 00:12:08,039
Get him to do it first.

366
00:12:08,039 --> 00:12:09,369
(Get Jae Seok to do it first.)

367
00:12:09,369 --> 00:12:12,009
Since it's about acting, you should do it first.

368
00:12:12,009 --> 00:12:14,539
Come on, Jae Seok. You act a lot on "Hangout with Yoo."

369
00:12:14,739 --> 00:12:16,479
Hey, I just do comedy skits.

370
00:12:16,479 --> 00:12:17,549
That's also acting.

371
00:12:18,249 --> 00:12:19,449
Since we're on the subject,

372
00:12:20,019 --> 00:12:22,419
- comedy acting is the hardest.
- It's the hardest.

373
00:12:22,419 --> 00:12:23,889
- Right.
- Totally.

374
00:12:24,119 --> 00:12:26,189
- You two can pull off...
- Right.

375
00:12:26,189 --> 00:12:27,919
such a difficult task.

376
00:12:27,919 --> 00:12:30,759
My gosh, you can't compare my acting to his comedy skits.

377
00:12:31,329 --> 00:12:33,459
He's doing it without any foundation.

378
00:12:33,859 --> 00:12:35,329
(In disbelief)

379
00:12:35,329 --> 00:12:36,799
I analyze my characters...

380
00:12:36,799 --> 00:12:38,299
