- Right.

381
00:12:38,699 --> 00:12:40,569
Shouldn't it be the other way around?

382
00:12:40,999 --> 00:12:42,069
You should say I analyze my characters...

383
00:12:42,069 --> 00:12:43,139
and have a clear structure...

384
00:12:43,139 --> 00:12:44,409
- and you don't have any foundation.
- Come on.

385
00:12:44,739 --> 00:12:45,809
That's crazy talk.

386
00:12:45,979 --> 00:12:48,139
- Come on.
- You don't even have a script.

387
00:12:48,139 --> 00:12:50,409
- You just do whatever you want.
- Gosh, you ruined my morning.

388
00:12:51,149 --> 00:12:53,319
Every word that comes out of your mouth is ruining my mood.

389
00:12:53,379 --> 00:12:55,149
How dare you compare me to him?

390
00:12:55,149 --> 00:12:56,889
