- Really?
- Wait. "Pop, pop, pop."

397
00:13:11,869 --> 00:13:12,969
Then...

398
00:13:13,599 --> 00:13:15,899
- is it an aerobics class?
- It's that way.

399
00:13:15,899 --> 00:13:18,009
- I guess they exercise.
- It has to do with exercising.

400
00:13:18,009 --> 00:13:19,169
- Wait. What makes a popping sound?
- Pop...

401
00:13:19,169 --> 00:13:20,209
- "Pop, pop, pop?"
- Is it really table tennis?

402
00:13:21,079 --> 00:13:22,409
My gosh. It's huge.

403
00:13:22,409 --> 00:13:23,449
