404
00:13:23,449 --> 00:13:24,949
- It's a huge center.
- The sports center...

405
00:13:26,019 --> 00:13:27,779
"Pilates." "Yoga." They've got everything here.

406
00:13:27,779 --> 00:13:29,449
Wait. I smell a swimming pool.

407
00:13:29,449 --> 00:13:30,449
Yes, me too.

408
00:13:30,649 --> 00:13:31,749
Hello.

409
00:13:31,749 --> 00:13:32,889
Gosh, there are so many people.

410
00:13:32,889 --> 00:13:34,589
- Fourth floor.
- My gosh. Look at this place.

411
00:13:34,989 --> 00:13:36,329
Oh, my. This place...

412
00:13:36,359 --> 00:13:38,129
We have to go to the main gym on the fourth floor.

413
00:13:38,529 --> 00:13:39,729
- The main gym?
- Is it basketball?

414
00:13:40,459 --> 00:13:41,559
That's possible.

415
00:13:41,699 --> 00:13:42,769
I got it.

416
00:13:43,099 --> 00:13:44,799
- I think it's basketball.
- Let's go.

417
00:13:44,929 --> 00:13:46,639
- It's not basketball.
- I hear small balls.

418
00:13:46,639 --> 00:13:47,799
It sounds like badminton.

419
00:13:47,799 --> 00:13:50,239
- It's a clean ball sound.
- Oh, this is it.

420
00:13:50,969 --> 00:13:52,369
I see. It's the sport with those paddles.

421
00:13:52,369 --> 00:13:54,439
- It's a trendy sport now.
- It's trending now.

422
00:13:55,339 --> 00:13:56,349
Hello.

423
00:13:56,579 --> 00:13:58,579
- Gosh, hello.
- Hello.

424
00:13:59,309 --> 00:14:00,949
- Hello.
- Nice to meet you.

425
00:14:01,149 --> 00:14:03,189
- What's the name of this sport?
- What is it called?

426
00:14:03,189 --> 00:14:04,189
- Pickleball.
- Pickleball.

427
00:14:04,189 --> 00:14:05,389
- Pickleball?
- Yes.

428
00:14:05,389 --> 00:14:07,319
- Pickleball.
- Pickleball.

429
00:14:07,359 --> 00:14:08,359
I see.

430
00:14:08,359 --> 00:14:11,529
(The first Whenever Guest: Park Jung Hwa)

431
00:14:11,529 --> 00:14:12,699
This is a nice gym.

432
00:14:12,699 --> 00:14:14,559
- It's big too.
- Isn't this a great gym?

433
00:14:14,559 --> 00:14:17,799
People aren't that familiar with pickleball.

434
00:14:17,799 --> 00:14:20,799
- Yes.
- So it combines many elements...

435
00:14:20,799 --> 00:14:22,439
- of other sports, right?
- That's right.

436
00:14:22,439 --> 00:14:24,169
- Table tennis and tennis.
- Table tennis, tennis,

437
00:14:24,169 --> 00:14:26,379
- and badminton. Yes.
- Badminton? It combines...

438
00:14:26,379 --> 00:14:27,379
