439
00:14:27,379 --> 00:14:28,509
- Yes.
- That's right.

440
00:14:28,509 --> 00:14:30,709
We're using a paddle just like in table tennis.

441
00:14:30,879 --> 00:14:33,019
The rules are very similar to tennis.

442
00:14:33,019 --> 00:14:34,449
- Really?
- Yes.

443
00:14:34,649 --> 00:14:36,889
And the court is smaller, right?

444
00:14:37,049 --> 00:14:38,449
- It's like a badminton court.
- Right.

445
00:14:38,449 --> 00:14:40,459
- The same as a badminton court?
- Yes.

446
00:14:40,589 --> 00:14:42,159
Pickleball has only the good elements of those sports.

447
00:14:42,159 --> 00:14:44,659
This sport is good for senior citizens.

448
00:14:44,659 --> 00:14:46,229
I see. Really?

449
00:14:46,899 --> 00:14:48,759
("Jin of BTS Is Hooked on Pickleball")

450
00:14:49,699 --> 00:14:50,699
(Jin)

451
00:14:50,699 --> 00:14:52,999
(Even BTS loves this sport.)

452
00:14:52,999 --> 00:14:54,399
(V, j-hope)

453
00:14:54,869 --> 00:14:57,239
(It started with Bill Gates, the 1st generation of players.)

454
00:14:58,169 --> 00:15:00,439
(Even superstars are getting into pickleball.)

455
00:15:00,709 --> 00:15:02,779
(To ride the global wave,)

456
00:15:03,049 --> 00:15:05,849
(they trade shots and sweat it out day in and day out.)

457
00:15:06,619 --> 00:15:09,349
(Here are today's first Whenever Guests.)

458
00:15:10,219 --> 00:15:14,119
(The pickleball club at Gwangjin-gu Community Sports Center)

459
00:15:14,589 --> 00:15:16,529
So do you guys meet up here at this time every day...

460
00:15:16,529 --> 00:15:18,459
to play pickleball?

461
00:15:18,459 --> 00:15:19,859
- Yes.
- Yes. We meet in the morning.

462
00:15:19,859 --> 00:15:21,029
From Monday to Friday.

463
00:15:21,029 --> 00:15:22,299
(The club meets up every morning.)

464
00:15:22,559 --> 00:15:25,099
So have you been playing the sport for 1 or 2 years?

465
00:15:25,099 --> 00:15:27,769
I've been playing for two years now.

466
00:15:27,769 --> 00:15:28,769
- Really?
- Yes.

467
00:15:28,769 --> 00:15:31,039
- I've been playing for 7 months.
- It's been 7 months?

468
00:15:31,039 --> 00:15:32,639
