00:41:55,559 --> 00:41:57,089
- Proactively.
- Proactively.

1242
00:41:57,259 --> 00:41:58,829
- Here we go, okay? In 1, 2, 3.
- In 1, 2, 3.

1243
00:41:58,829 --> 00:41:59,829
- Here we go!
- Here we go!

1244
00:41:59,829 --> 00:42:01,659
The last try. Ready.

1245
00:42:01,659 --> 00:42:02,699
(Out of 10 total tries, they're on the last try.)

1246
00:42:02,699 --> 00:42:03,829
Ready.

1247
00:42:04,159 --> 00:42:05,269
Stay strong.

1248
00:42:05,999 --> 00:42:07,299
Save the ball, no matter what.

1249
00:42:07,367 --> 00:42:12,337
(The last try with everything on the line)

1250
00:42:13,873 --> 00:42:16,073
(Last try)

1251
00:42:16,073 --> 00:42:17,613
- Okay.
- Tae Hyun.

1252
00:42:17,679 --> 00:42:18,779
- Sorry.
- Oh, no.

1253
00:42:18,779 --> 00:42:20,319
- Here.
- Okay.

1254
00:42:20,619 --> 00:42:21,679
- Gosh.
- Oh, no.

1255
00:42:21,919 --> 00:42:23,149
(Reset)

1256
00:42:23,549 --> 00:42:25,719
(Last try)

1257
00:42:33,259 --> 00:42:34,299
(Yeon Seok saved it!)

1258
00:42:38,029 --> 00:42:39,129
Nice!

1259
00:42:46,479 --> 00:42:49,979
(Jae Seok's final one shot!)

1260
00:42:58,819 --> 00:42:59,819
(A miraulous success on the last try)

1261
00:42:59,819 --> 00:43:01,359
We did it!

1262
00:43:05,859 --> 00:43:06,859
We did it!

1263
00:43:17,509 --> 00:43:19,509
(Yu Jae Seok's goodbye home run)

1264
00:43:20,139 --> 00:43:21,509
(The perfect teamwork led to success.)

1265
00:43:21,509 --> 00:43:22,509
They did it!

1266
00:43:23,979 --> 00:43:25,479
We can have a meal together!

1267
00:43:25,479 --> 00:43:26,879
(Crying)

1268
00:43:27,179 --> 00:43:28,549
- That was amazing.
- Round Three,

1269
00:43:28,779 --> 00:43:30,189
- success!
- Success!

1270
00:43:30,189 --> 00:43:32,249
(Round 3 success)

1271
00:43:33,619 --> 00:43:34,689
The last shot...

1272
00:43:34,689 --> 00:43:36,859
It was the winning smash.

1273
00:43:38,129 --> 00:43:39,159
You did it.

1274
00:43:39,159 --> 00:43:40,229
(Jae Seok is the best!)

1275
00:43:40,229 --> 00:43:41,299
You did it, Jae Seok.

1276
00:43:41,299 --> 00:43:42,499
I hit it thinking it was all or nothing.

1277
00:43:43,299 --> 00:43:44,299
Amazing!

1278
00:43:44,799 --> 00:43:47,939
I remember nothing after I dove for the ball.

1279
00:43:47,939 --> 00:43:49,439
- I can't.
- I can't remember anything since.

1280
00:43:49,439 --> 00:43:51,639
(The season's first success after they threw themselves into it)

1281
00:43:51,639 --> 00:43:53,179
It's the first dopamine rush after months.

1282
00:43:53,179 --> 00:43:55,609
- It sure gave us a dopamine rush.
- Totally.

1283
00:43:56,149 --> 00:43:57,279
Congratulations.

1284
00:43:58,179 --> 00:43:59,679
- Congratulations.
- Thank you.

1285
00:44:00,149 --> 00:44:01,449
Thank you.

1286
00:44:01,449 --> 00:44:03,149
Play or Pass.

1287
00:44:03,149 --> 00:44:05,049
Congratulations on even securing the get-together money.

1288
00:44:05,049 --> 00:44:07,419
(Won tumblers, team uniforms, and get-together money)

1289
00:44:07,419 --> 00:44:09,629
- Thank you.
- Oh, my gosh!

1290
00:44:11,189 --> 00:44:13,159
- I'm on the verge of crying.
- With this,

1291
00:44:13,159 --> 00:44:14,899
you must have a get-together.

1292
00:44:14,899 --> 00:44:15,929
- Right?
- Yes.

1293
00:44:15,929 --> 00:44:18,069
- It'll help you get along.
- Absolutely.

1294
00:44:18,369 --> 00:44:19,799
How was it today?

1295
00:44:20,399 --> 00:44:23,339
It feels like a dream. I'm about to cry. Oh, dear.

1296
00:44:24,609 --> 00:44:27,039
I hope our team and coach...

1297
00:44:27,039 --> 00:44:30,609
- Yes, together.
- stay together for a long time.

1298
00:44:31,209 --> 00:44:34,119
(Getting emotional again)

1299
00:44:34,749 --> 00:44:36,519
It's as if...

1300
00:44:36,519 --> 00:44:39,489
she has won in a pickleball competition.

1301
00:44:39,719 --> 00:44:41,659
- It's like a winner's speech.
- This is way better than winning.

1302
00:44:41,659 --> 00:44:42,659
I agree.

1303
00:44:42,659 --> 00:44:44,359
We can finally have a get-together.

1304
00:44:44,359 --> 00:44:46,529
- Right?
- Thank you so much.

1305
00:44:46,659 --> 00:44:47,759
Whenever possible,

1306
00:44:47,759 --> 00:44:49,399
- play or pass!
- Play or pass!

1307
00:44:49,399 --> 00:44:50,469
(We've gotten close.)

1308
00:44:50,469 --> 00:44:52,029
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

1309
00:44:52,029 --> 00:44:53,339
- Bye.
- Take care.

1310
00:44:53,339 --> 00:44:54,369
(After wrapping up the first spare time on a happy note)

1311
00:44:54,669 --> 00:44:55,699
(Groaning)

1312
00:44:59,779 --> 00:45:00,839
Unbelievable.

1313
00:45:01,239 --> 00:45:02,309
What a relief.

1314
00:45:02,309 --> 00:45:03,949
- It's a relief we succeeded.
- For real.

1315
00:45:03,949 --> 00:45:04,979
It's a big relief.

1316
00:45:05,179 --> 00:45:06,179
(In a daze)

1317
00:45:06,179 --> 00:45:07,419
You know...

1318
00:45:07,749 --> 00:45:10,989
When the first hit failed, I thought it was over.

1319
00:45:11,189 --> 00:45:13,359
- But the ball was saved...
- I don't even know how it happened.

1320
00:45:13,919 --> 00:45:15,089
- Right?
- The next moment,

1321
00:45:15,089 --> 00:45:16,229
- we had succeeded.
- Someone tried, right?

1322
00:45:16,229 --> 00:45:17,659
- It felt like...
- Really?

1323
00:45:17,659 --> 00:45:18,959
The ball bounced off...

1324
00:45:18,959 --> 00:45:20,359
- of something, right?
- I tried.

1325
00:45:21,659 --> 00:45:23,869
(Jae Seok's 1st try failed as the ball bounced off the box)

1326
00:45:24,769 --> 00:45:26,669
- Ki Joo saved it.
- I remember it now.

1327
00:45:26,669 --> 00:45:28,599
- Tae Hyun hit it.
- Yes.

1328
00:45:28,599 --> 00:45:31,209
(Jae Seok's finishing hit)

1329
00:45:32,069 --> 00:45:33,579
I got the ball.

1330
00:45:33,579 --> 00:45:35,979
Either way, my knees hurt when it was over.

1331
00:45:36,949 --> 00:45:38,149
I don't know what happened.

1332
00:45:38,149 --> 00:45:39,979
(Reason behind the pain)

1333
00:45:39,979 --> 00:45:42,549
Every time Tae Hyun is on the show, we miraculously succeed.

1334
00:45:42,549 --> 00:45:43,549
That's right.

1335
00:45:43,549 --> 00:45:45,889
He sure is the one-of-a-kind gem of this show.

1336
00:45:46,219 --> 00:45:48,119
Am I? Am I a gem?

1337
00:45:48,119 --> 00:45:49,629
(A one-of-a-kind gem trove of luck)

1338
00:45:49,629 --> 00:45:51,529
We deserve something delicious.

1339
00:45:52,229 --> 00:45:53,329
Let's have something good.

1340
00:45:53,329 --> 00:45:54,459
Ki Joo is...

1341
00:45:55,529 --> 00:45:56,699
- Ki Joo...
- Sorry?

1342
00:45:57,169 --> 00:45:58,269
is exhausted.

1343
00:45:58,269 --> 00:45:59,329
(Semi-conscious)

1344
00:45:59,329 --> 00:46:00,669
Didn't you know a good place, Ki Joo?

1345
00:46:00,669 --> 00:46:01,969
(A local spot to refuel)

1346
00:46:01,969 --> 00:46:04,569
A nearby place serves both...

1347
00:46:04,569 --> 00:46:05,909
kalguksu and bossam.

1348
00:46:06,379 --> 00:46:07,879
It's in that direction from here.

1349
00:46:07,879 --> 00:46:09,079
- Is it far from here?
- They serve kalguksu,

1350
00:46:09,079 --> 00:46:10,779
kongguksu in summer,

1351
00:46:10,779 --> 00:46:12,509
- Let's go there.
- and bossam.

1352
00:46:12,509 --> 00:46:13,549
That'd be better.

1353
00:46:13,549 --> 00:46:14,579
(Setting off immediately)

1354
00:46:14,579 --> 00:46:17,149
The excitement I felt from succeeding isn't cooling down.

1355
00:46:17,149 --> 00:46:18,219
It's not.

1356
00:46:18,489 --> 00:46:19,559
(Leaving triumphantly for the first time this season)

1357
00:46:19,559 --> 00:46:20,789
- We...
- It's still hard to believe.

1358
00:46:21,489 --> 00:46:23,059
- Seriously.
- Let's calm down with some food.

1359
00:46:24,759 --> 00:46:25,889
I'm starving.

1360
00:46:26,199 --> 00:46:27,299
- Are you?
- Yes.

1361
00:46:28,159 --> 00:46:30,269
- The hunger is really hitting now.
- It's about time we got hungry.

1362
00:46:30,329 --> 00:46:32,199
- It's that time of the day.
- It's only natural.

1363
00:46:34,199 --> 00:46:35,299
(Staring)

1364
00:46:35,739 --> 00:46:36,909
It must be cool in there.

1365
00:46:37,509 --> 00:46:38,539
Where?

1366
00:46:38,569 --> 00:46:39,609
In that store.

1367
00:46:39,909 --> 00:46:41,079
- Do you feel hot?
- Yes.

1368
00:46:41,079 --> 00:46:43,349
(The type to talk to herself loudly)

1369
00:46:44,009 --> 00:46:45,849
(They made it to the bus stop in the heat.)

1370
00:46:45,949 --> 00:46:47,419
It's the way from there.

1371
00:46:47,419 --> 00:46:48,949
Gwangjang-dong Hyundai Apartment.

1372
00:46:49,649 --> 00:46:51,089
- Two stops.
- Two stops?

1373
00:46:52,959 --> 00:46:54,619
The bus will be here in 1 to 2 minutes.

1374
00:46:56,459 --> 00:46:59,259
- Actually, in five minutes.
- We have five minutes?

1375
00:47:01,259 --> 00:47:02,499
No, wait.

1376
00:47:03,469 --> 00:47:04,569
Five minutes.

1377
00:47:04,569 --> 00:47:06,769
Isn't that also a kalguksu place?

1378
00:47:06,899 --> 00:47:08,369
- Where?
- Up ahead.

1379
00:47:08,369 --> 00:47:09,969
The one next to the gas station.

1380
00:47:09,969 --> 00:47:11,769
- Deungchon Shabu Kalguksu?
- Yes.

1381
00:47:12,239 --> 00:47:14,609
- Or how about house-made galbi?
- Shall we go?

1382
00:47:14,979 --> 00:47:16,309
- House-made galbi?
- Shall we go?

1383
00:47:16,309 --> 00:47:17,309
(Already looking elsewhere)

1384
00:47:17,309 --> 00:47:19,409
- Or over here?
- Where?

1385
00:47:19,479 --> 00:47:20,519
Walkerhill?

1386
00:47:21,079 --> 00:47:22,679
- Pizza Hill?
- Pizza Hill?

1387
00:47:22,679 --> 00:47:24,019
- Pizza?
- I haven't tried it yet.

1388
00:47:24,019 --> 00:47:25,619
- Shall we have pizza?
- I heard it was famous.

1389
00:47:25,619 --> 00:47:27,189
Yes, it's famous. The pizza is quite pricey.

1390
00:47:27,189 --> 00:47:28,189
- Is that so?
- Yes.

1391
00:47:28,189 --> 00:47:29,389
- Isn't the loser of the game...
- It's really expensive.

1392
00:47:29,389 --> 00:47:31,159
going to pay for the meal?

1393
00:47:31,689 --> 00:47:33,129
- We...
- Are we getting pizza?

1394
00:47:33,199 --> 00:47:34,299
Should we just go?

1395
00:47:35,499 --> 00:47:37,699
We succeeded. Don't we deserve something nice?

1396
00:47:38,129 --> 00:47:39,399
- Wait.
- I've heard about...

1397
00:47:39,399 --> 00:47:41,499
the place but haven't been yet.

1398
00:47:41,499 --> 00:47:42,499
(Should we raise the stakes?)

1399
00:47:42,499 --> 00:47:44,239
But going to the next spot afterward from Pizza Hill...

1400
00:47:44,239 --> 00:47:45,839
is going to be a hassle.

1401
00:47:45,839 --> 00:47:47,039
- True.
- It's too far.

1402
00:47:47,039 --> 00:47:48,279
- It'll be a real hassle.
- For sure.

1403
00:47:48,509 --> 00:47:49,749
I'll pay for all four of us.

1404
00:47:49,749 --> 00:47:50,779
Okay.

1405
00:47:50,779 --> 00:47:52,809
- All right.
- Up I go.

1406
00:47:53,579 --> 00:47:54,679
- To the back?
- Okay.

1407
00:47:56,079 --> 00:47:57,089
(Yelping)

1408
00:47:58,289 --> 00:47:59,349
You make a lot of sound effects, Ki Joo.

1409
00:48:00,989 --> 00:48:02,059
Gosh.

1410
00:48:03,529 --> 00:48:05,059
Sitting down sure is nice.

1411
00:48:05,659 --> 00:48:06,699
Right?

1412
00:48:06,699 --> 00:48:08,259
- We needed a break.
- Yes.

1413
00:48:08,929 --> 00:48:10,669
We ran at least 5,000 steps.

1414
00:48:10,669 --> 00:48:11,699
Already?

1415
00:48:12,229 --> 00:48:14,039
Pickleball is indeed a workout.

1416
00:48:14,569 --> 00:48:16,609
- It looked fun.
- It's actually fun.

1417
00:48:17,339 --> 00:48:19,509
- Pickleball?
- What we played was more fun.

1418
00:48:20,579 --> 00:48:21,779
Tell the team to try it.

1419
00:48:21,779 --> 00:48:22,949
(Highly satisfied with the game)

1420
00:48:22,949 --> 00:48:24,879
- They will get along much faster.
- Totally.

1421
00:48:25,379 --> 00:48:26,949
To get to know the members, that game...

1422
00:48:26,949 --> 00:48:28,049
- The best one.
- is the best.

1423
00:48:28,049 --> 00:48:29,379
But you know,

1424
00:48:29,379 --> 00:48:31,789
a casual relationship like theirs isn't all that bad.

1425
00:48:32,219 --> 00:48:34,059
- It's great.
- Exactly.

1426
00:48:34,059 --> 00:48:36,389
- Get to know what someone does, - Right.

1427
00:48:36,389 --> 00:48:38,559
and they'll just ask for money.

1428
00:48:38,859 --> 00:48:39,899
They'll only cause trouble.

1429
00:48:40,729 --> 00:48:42,529
We need to walk a little from here.

1430
00:48:42,529 --> 00:48:44,229
- A four-minute walk?
- Yes.

1431
00:48:44,669 --> 00:48:45,869
Is it raining?

1432
00:48:45,869 --> 00:48:46,939
To the left.

1433
00:48:47,099 --> 00:48:48,569
Ki Joo should know the way from here.

1434
00:48:48,569 --> 00:48:50,409
- Yes, I do.
- You do, right?

1435
00:48:50,409 --> 00:48:51,509
Yes, I know the way.

1436
00:48:51,769 --> 00:48:53,009
We're almost there.

1437
00:48:53,009 --> 00:48:55,139
Yes. We just have to turn at that corner.

1438
00:48:55,139 --> 00:48:56,239
- Great.
- Correct.

1439
00:48:56,239 --> 00:48:57,779
(A familiar restaurant she can find without a map)

1440
00:48:57,779 --> 00:48:58,979
It's visible from here.

1441
00:48:59,079 --> 00:49:00,649
- Where?
- That kalguksu place.

1442
00:49:00,649 --> 00:49:01,649
It's over there.

1443
00:49:01,779 --> 00:49:02,919
That looks good.

1444
00:49:02,919 --> 00:49:04,589
Is it all right? Yes?

1445
00:49:04,589 --> 00:49:06,049
- It looks great, Ki Joo.
- Come on.

1446
00:49:06,049 --> 00:49:08,159
- Hello.
- Gosh. Hello.

1447
00:49:08,159 --> 00:49:09,159
(Entering the kalguksu place)

1448
00:49:09,159 --> 00:49:10,759
- I love it.
- Goodness.

1449
00:49:10,759 --> 00:49:12,959
- Gosh.
- Why are you groaning?

1450
00:49:13,629 --> 00:49:15,699
(Scanning the menu)

1451
00:49:15,699 --> 00:49:17,229
They have many kinds of kalguksu.

1452
00:49:17,229 --> 00:49:18,599
Gosh. There are so many.

1453
00:49:18,799 --> 00:49:20,139
We should get bossam.

1454
00:49:20,439 --> 00:49:22,369
- Of course, we should.
- Mung bean bindaetteok is good.

1455
00:49:22,369 --> 00:49:23,539
Bossam's tasty too.

1456
00:49:24,069 --> 00:49:25,209
There's napa cabbage soup too.

1457
00:49:25,209 --> 00:49:26,579
It's tasty.

1458
00:49:26,579 --> 00:49:28,039
- Is the soup good?
- Yes.

1459
00:49:28,839 --> 00:49:31,349
- Let's order what each wants.
- Sure.

1460
00:49:31,609 --> 00:49:32,679
What about you, Tae Hyun?

1461
00:49:32,809 --> 00:49:35,079
I'll have 2 bites of kongguksu and 2 bites of kalguksu.

1462
00:49:35,349 --> 00:49:36,349
(Booing)

1463
00:49:36,349 --> 00:49:37,419
Do you want to share them with me, then?

1464
00:49:37,419 --> 00:49:38,949
- Order two of each, then.
- Let's share.

1465
00:49:38,949 --> 00:49:40,019
- Two kalguksu and...
- Yes.

1466
00:49:40,019 --> 00:49:41,619
Order one of each for them to share.

1467
00:49:41,619 --> 00:49:42,759
- Shall we?
- Two kalguksu.

1468
00:49:43,059 --> 00:49:44,559
- Could we order now?
- Yes.

1469
00:49:44,989 --> 00:49:47,129
Two kalguksu made with ox bone soup.

1470
00:49:47,799 --> 00:49:49,199
And two kongguksu.

1471
00:49:49,459 --> 00:49:52,029
And will a medium bossam be enough for us?

1472
00:49:52,199 --> 00:49:53,599
Aren't you going to have the mung bean bindaetteok?

1473
00:49:53,599 --> 00:49:55,339
- I was thinking...
- I'm going to have it.

1474
00:49:55,439 --> 00:49:57,539
- Ma'am.
- One mung bean bindaetteok, please.

1475
00:49:57,539 --> 00:49:58,609
- Okay.
- Yes.

1476
00:49:58,609 --> 00:50:00,679
(Satisfied)

1477
00:50:04,079 --> 00:50:06,309
- Gosh. I'm so sleepy.
- Goodness.

1478
00:50:06,309 --> 00:50:07,449
You are tired.

1479
00:50:07,449 --> 00:50:09,449
- We worked up a sweat earlier.
- Gosh.

1480
00:50:09,749 --> 00:50:11,619
- That game required lots of energy.
- Yes.

1481
00:50:12,619 --> 00:50:14,819
- We practiced a lot too.
- That's right.

1482
00:50:16,529 --> 00:50:17,589
It's nice and cool.

1483
00:50:17,589 --> 00:50:19,429
Ki Joo turned away and yawned just now.

1484
00:50:21,499 --> 00:50:22,629
She was like this.

1485
00:50:22,629 --> 00:50:23,869
(I saw it.)

1486
00:50:23,869 --> 00:50:25,199
(Ratting her out right away)

1487
00:50:25,199 --> 00:50:27,169
- It's because she's exhausted.
- She must be.

1488
00:50:27,169 --> 00:50:28,969
It's because you're suddenly relaxed.

1489
00:50:29,139 --> 00:50:30,669
- Really.
- Tonight,

1490
00:50:31,209 --> 00:50:34,039
